WEBVTT

00:02.100 --> 00:05.230
DŌMO, Laomoto-SAN.

00:05.230 --> 00:07.770
I am NARAKU NINJA.

00:10.070 --> 00:12.900
DŌMO, NARAKU NINJA-SAN.

00:12.900 --> 00:17.120
I am Laomoto Khan, the Demolition NINJA.

00:17.120 --> 00:17.530
YEEART!

00:18.450 --> 00:19.540
Impossible!

00:20.620 --> 00:21.450
GWARGH!

00:21.450 --> 00:22.500
SATSUBATSU!

00:22.500 --> 00:24.620
GWARGGGGGH!

00:26.380 --> 00:27.750
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

00:28.090 --> 00:31.460
What is the true identity of the NINJA SOUL who possessed him?

00:31.460 --> 00:33.630
Is this truly not a case of losing control?

00:33.630 --> 00:34.970
YEEART!

00:35.430 --> 00:36.890
GWAARGH!!!!

00:36.890 --> 00:38.680
You weakling!

00:38.680 --> 00:40.470
What is this power?

00:40.470 --> 00:42.180
Who are you?

00:42.180 --> 00:43.890
This is madness!

00:43.890 --> 00:46.350
Madness is what rules this world!

00:46.350 --> 00:48.440
This is INGAOHŌ!

00:48.440 --> 00:49.610
YEEART!

00:49.610 --> 00:50.650
Impossible!

00:50.650 --> 00:52.150
YEEART!

00:52.150 --> 00:53.280
A fatal error!

00:53.280 --> 00:53.900
YEEART!

00:53.900 --> 00:54.860
GWARGH!

00:55.530 --> 00:56.820
GUH! WARGH!

00:57.530 --> 00:58.370
YEEART!

00:58.370 --> 00:59.120
GWARGH!

01:00.120 --> 01:01.790
GUHHWARGH!

01:01.790 --> 01:02.450
YEEART!

01:02.450 --> 01:03.660
GWARGH!

01:04.120 --> 01:05.920
GWARGHHH!

01:05.920 --> 01:06.580
YEEART!

01:06.580 --> 01:07.920
GWARGH!

01:08.330 --> 01:09.630
GWUHHUHHUHH!

01:10.880 --> 01:12.880
YEEART!

01:11.300 --> 01:12.880
GWARGH!

01:13.550 --> 01:16.090
You still live after that?

01:16.090 --> 01:22.850
It seems Fujikido's body is not fully compatible with my NINJA MUSCLES.

01:16.090 --> 01:22.850
NOTE: NINJA MUSCLES move the NINJA SKELETON.

01:23.350 --> 01:24.640
YEEART!

01:25.640 --> 01:27.060
GWARGH!

01:28.400 --> 01:31.110
You shall suffer KAISHAKU!

01:31.110 --> 01:34.940
NARAKU NINJA continues to
be victorious on the battlefield.

01:34.940 --> 01:40.450
But what happened to the mind of the NINJA Slayer, Fujikido Kenji?

01:44.330 --> 01:46.250
NINJA! NINJA!

01:46.250 --> 01:48.920
You sure love NINJA, don't you, Tochinoki?

01:48.920 --> 01:50.540
He sure loves them.

01:50.540 --> 01:52.500
The ones I got him for Christmas?

01:52.500 --> 01:54.960
I noticed the drawing on the box a few days ago.

01:54.960 --> 01:57.470
Stop it... Stop, please!

01:57.470 --> 01:58.680
NINJA!

01:58.680 --> 02:00.390
There's no such thing as NINJA, though.

02:02.390 --> 02:04.890
I noticed the drawing on the box a few days ago.

02:04.890 --> 02:06.480
NINJA!

02:06.480 --> 02:08.100
I don't want to see this anymore!

02:08.100 --> 02:09.980
There's no such thing as NINJA, though.

02:09.980 --> 02:11.060
There's no such thing!

02:12.070 --> 02:14.280
Pathetic!

02:14.280 --> 02:19.110
You tried to burn away my power?
You make me laugh.

02:19.110 --> 02:24.490
I shall control your body for eternity!

02:24.490 --> 02:26.450
YEEART!

02:24.830 --> 02:26.450
GWARGH!

02:26.450 --> 02:28.000
Hellkite!

02:28.000 --> 02:30.290
What are you doing, you incompetent fool?!

02:30.290 --> 02:32.130
Hurry up and help me!

02:32.130 --> 02:37.010
I shall avenge your wife and child.

02:37.010 --> 02:44.600
And you can stay in the FUTON of your mind,
suffering and raging for eternity!

03:01.910 --> 03:03.240
YEEART!

03:05.200 --> 03:05.990
GWARGH!

03:07.200 --> 03:09.790
Fujikido's body is at its limit?

03:10.710 --> 03:11.420
YEEART!

03:11.420 --> 03:12.790
GWAAARGHH!

03:18.130 --> 03:20.010
Curse you, Fujikido...

03:20.010 --> 03:23.010
What are you planning?

03:32.520 --> 03:34.060
Darling...

03:34.060 --> 03:35.440
Daddy!

03:42.610 --> 03:44.820
Stop it, Fujikido!

03:44.820 --> 03:48.370
Hatred is the source of your power!

03:48.370 --> 03:50.120
Burn your hatred!

03:50.120 --> 03:52.790
Do you not want revenge?

03:52.790 --> 03:55.790
You'll never get another chance!

03:59.090 --> 04:00.720
FŪRIN KAZAN...

04:01.840 --> 04:03.010
CHADŌ.

04:04.300 --> 04:07.510
And... FŪRIN KAZAN!

04:08.100 --> 04:10.930
Fujikido, do you want to die?

04:14.520 --> 04:16.150
NARAKU NINJA,

04:16.150 --> 04:18.230
fellow inhabitant of my neurons,

04:18.230 --> 04:21.690
I cannot let you take over my mind!

04:21.690 --> 04:25.620
But it was none other than I who summoned you.

04:25.620 --> 04:28.280
I summoned you on that day!

04:28.280 --> 04:32.750
We live and die together. We are two souls in the same body!

04:33.210 --> 04:35.290
Now lend me your power, NARAKU!

04:35.290 --> 04:37.340
What selfishness!

04:37.340 --> 04:42.510
Would you deny your hatred and try to burn out every last bit of me, Fujikido?

04:42.510 --> 04:44.590
No, NARAKU!

04:44.590 --> 04:46.680
I will accept you.

04:46.680 --> 04:49.010
That night, I called you.

04:49.560 --> 04:53.640
The pitch-black madness, my hatred,
and the desire for revenge summoned you!

04:54.310 --> 04:57.360
You are a part of me!

04:57.360 --> 05:01.530
Fujikido found a ZEN truth
at the end of his CHADŌ.

05:01.530 --> 05:07.030
Without denying the darkness within him,
or becoming its servant and slave,

05:07.030 --> 05:11.620
he would accept it within himself, just like the memories of his beloved family!

05:12.500 --> 05:14.660
YEEART!

05:25.760 --> 05:27.220
WASSHOI!

05:33.310 --> 05:35.730
Come, Laomoto-SAN.

05:35.730 --> 05:41.860
He accepted NARAKU NINJA within himself and became truly one with him!

05:41.860 --> 05:43.990
You're still alive?!

05:47.410 --> 05:50.240
The enemy's soul belongs to the BIG NINJA CLAN.

05:47.410 --> 05:50.240
NOTE: BIG NINJA are very LARGE.

05:50.240 --> 05:53.450
Fight not with power, but with speed!

05:53.450 --> 05:54.750
Fine with me!

05:55.660 --> 05:56.790
YEEART!

06:01.250 --> 06:03.050
GWAAARRGHH!

06:07.930 --> 06:09.640
Don't, Fujikido!

06:09.640 --> 06:13.930
This is the STRIKE ABSORBING STANCE of the ITAMI NINJA CLAN.

06:13.930 --> 06:17.940
You remember how to deal with the ITAMI NINJA CLAN, right?

06:17.940 --> 06:19.270
Of course!

06:22.020 --> 06:23.570
GWARGH!

06:23.570 --> 06:29.410
I-Impossible! How could he know the identities of my seven souls?!

06:29.410 --> 06:33.330
Now, Fujikido, let us finish this now!

06:33.330 --> 06:34.580
YEEART!

06:34.580 --> 06:35.580
You're mine!

06:35.580 --> 06:38.410
GWAAAAAARRGGGGHHHHHHH!

06:41.290 --> 06:43.420
That's the MOZ NINJA CLAN!

06:44.880 --> 06:46.210
YEEART!

06:50.380 --> 06:51.340
GWARGH!

06:51.550 --> 06:53.350
GWARGH!

06:54.180 --> 06:55.260
YEEART!

06:55.640 --> 06:57.560
No, turn around!

06:57.560 --> 06:59.190
YEEART!

07:00.350 --> 07:03.940
My MOZ NINJA CLAN airborne attack was a feint!

07:03.940 --> 07:07.740
I was waiting for you to let your guard down and charge straight—

07:07.740 --> 07:08.530
Impossible!

07:08.530 --> 07:09.860
YEEART!

07:10.240 --> 07:12.620
Let me control your body!

07:12.620 --> 07:13.740
Do it, NARAKU!

07:14.410 --> 07:15.490
YEEART!

07:18.960 --> 07:20.580
SATSUBATSU!

07:24.960 --> 07:25.630
YEEART!

07:25.630 --> 07:27.210
GWARGH!

07:28.920 --> 07:30.340
YEEART!

07:32.840 --> 07:34.510
AIYEEEAAAARGHHHH!

07:34.510 --> 07:36.640
Fujikido, look below you!

07:37.140 --> 07:39.390
What a fatal error!

07:42.100 --> 07:43.480
That's...

07:43.690 --> 07:45.730
For Laomoto-SAN!

07:45.730 --> 07:46.270
What?!

07:46.270 --> 07:48.900
Accursed demon!

07:48.900 --> 07:54.280
Fujikido's body can't withstand that many KARATE MISSILES.

07:48.900 --> 07:54.280
NOTE: KARATE MISSILES are long-range KARATE.

07:54.280 --> 07:58.540
I'll have to dedicate every ounce of power I have to defense...

07:58.540 --> 08:00.830
HISSATSU WAZA!

08:00.830 --> 08:02.670
YEEART!

08:02.670 --> 08:04.540
It won't make it in time?

08:05.210 --> 08:06.840
What are you doing, NARAKU?

08:08.590 --> 08:09.670
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

08:09.960 --> 08:12.550
Laomoto-SAN, BANZAI!

08:12.550 --> 08:14.720
SAYŌNARA!

08:18.310 --> 08:20.730
YEEART!

08:39.370 --> 08:40.790
I've won!

08:40.790 --> 08:48.420
Did you think you could defeat me, the Demolition NINJA,
head of the SŌKAIYA SYNDICATE?

08:48.420 --> 08:51.090
NINJAS must be slain.

08:54.930 --> 08:56.090
YEEART!

08:56.090 --> 08:57.800
GWARGH!

09:17.240 --> 09:19.450
NINJAS must be slain!

09:20.910 --> 09:22.580
Wait!

09:22.580 --> 09:24.500
I concede defeat.

09:25.000 --> 09:28.540
I'll give you whatever you want.

09:29.250 --> 09:31.880
So you want to know my demands?

09:32.380 --> 09:33.760
That's right.

09:33.760 --> 09:37.890
I'll give you everything you want.

09:39.720 --> 09:42.470
What I want is...

09:45.810 --> 09:48.440
...your life!

09:49.310 --> 09:50.820
WASSHOI!

09:50.820 --> 09:52.570
WASSHOI!

09:55.360 --> 09:57.320
NINJAS must be slain!

09:57.320 --> 09:59.700
YEEART!

09:59.700 --> 10:06.960
GWAAAAAAAAARRRRRRRRGGGGGGGGGHHHHHHHH!

10:07.290 --> 10:11.210
Damn you, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

10:11.210 --> 10:15.510
I can't... I can't...

10:16.090 --> 10:17.050
SA... YŌ... NA... RA!

10:44.740 --> 10:46.500
Are you awake?

10:47.000 --> 10:50.040
How did I get here?

10:50.040 --> 10:53.590
Are you always like this?

10:53.590 --> 10:56.210
But I won't ask what happened.

10:56.210 --> 10:57.130
Not now.

10:57.880 --> 11:00.090
Laomoto...

11:00.090 --> 11:01.840
It's over.

11:01.840 --> 11:03.010
I'm sure of it.

11:04.180 --> 11:05.760
It's over?

11:07.810 --> 11:10.440
I'm sure it's over. Everything is.

11:10.900 --> 11:12.770
Everything is over?

11:16.730 --> 11:19.280
Let the terror come to an end.

11:19.280 --> 11:21.450
Rest.

11:21.450 --> 11:24.950
And take back your life.

11:24.950 --> 11:26.990
My life?

11:26.990 --> 11:30.540
You've suffered more than enough.

11:30.540 --> 11:33.250
Far more than enough.

11:33.250 --> 11:35.590
Take back your life.

11:36.460 --> 11:38.630
Take back... my life?

11:39.760 --> 11:41.220
Fuyuko!

11:41.220 --> 11:41.760
Tochino—

11:41.760 --> 11:43.010
GWARGH!

11:43.760 --> 11:44.720
Nancy-SAN?!

11:44.720 --> 11:45.800
Good morning.

11:45.800 --> 11:48.180
We're at the tower's remains, right?

11:49.600 --> 11:52.690
Nothing's changed? I see...

11:52.690 --> 11:54.690
I injected you with ZBR adrenaline.

11:54.690 --> 11:58.690
If you're a naturalist, I'm sorry,
but it was an emergency.

11:54.690 --> 11:58.690
NOTE: NATURALISTS are STRAIGHT EDGE.

11:58.690 --> 12:02.700
No... you saved me. I'm grateful.

12:02.700 --> 12:03.610
What time is it?

12:03.610 --> 12:05.120
It's almost dawn.

12:05.660 --> 12:08.740
Nancy-SAN, did I succeed?

12:13.420 --> 12:15.250
INGAOHŌ.

12:15.250 --> 12:16.960
I see.

12:17.460 --> 12:20.590
Yes. There's no time to think, you see.

12:20.590 --> 12:22.510
We need to escape.

12:22.510 --> 12:23.430
What?

12:57.290 --> 13:01.050
You probably know this, but that wasn't part of my plan.

13:08.760 --> 13:12.220
Neo-Saitama is in flames.

13:13.310 --> 13:14.980
THIS IS A FREE FANSUB!
DO NOT BUY, SELL, OR RENT!

13:14.980 --> 13:16.310
(BUT LEGAL STREAMING IS OKAY.)

